      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 692,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0057006F0075006C006400200079006F00750020006A0075007300740020006500780070006C00610069006E003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Well, now! That’s a dull response, isn’t it?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 740,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00570065006C006C002C0020006E006F00770021002000540068006100742019007300200061002000640075006C006C00200072006500730070006F006E00730065002C002000690073006E20190074002000690074003F00100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 49
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Fine. If you’re going to be so very boring, then I’ll\njust get to the point.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nSee, my predecessor left me with a little\nhomework.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 840,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 136
    },
    {
      "displayText": "He asked me to entrust some of his Pokémon to\nany interesting Trainers I came across in my work.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nAnd despite your disappointing reaction just now,\nyou’re generally pretty interesting.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1112,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 191
    },
    {
      "displayText": "But it seems you’re in no position to take any\nmore Pokémon with you.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nGo through your Boxes, then come see me again.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1496,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 124
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pokémon. Present yourselves well.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1744,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0050006F006B00E9006D006F006E002E002000500072006500730065006E007400200079006F0075007200730065006C007600650073002000770065006C006C002E00100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Don’t be shy! Go on and choose one.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1820,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0044006F006E201900740020006200650020007300680079002100200047006F0020006F006E00200061006E0064002000630068006F006F007300650020006F006E0065002E00100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "That’s the Fire-type Pokémon Charmander.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1900,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005400680061007420190073002000740068006500200046006900720065002D007400790070006500200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E00200043006800610072006D0061006E006400650072002E00100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "That’s the Water-type Pokémon Squirtle.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1992,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0054006800610074201900730020007400680065002000570061007400650072002D007400790070006500200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E0020005300710075006900720074006C0065002E00100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "That’s the Grass-type Pokémon Bulbasaur.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2080,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0054006800610074201900730020007400680065002000470072006100730073002D007400790070006500200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E002000420075006C006200610073006100750072002E00100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I told you to choose a Pokémon!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2172,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004900200074006F006C006400200079006F007500200074006F002000630068006F006F007300650020006100200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E002100100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "So <U+0010><U+0002>ā<U+0002>’s the one you want?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
