      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>봆<U+0000>You’d better not let me down for thinking you’re\nactually any fun. Show this <U+0010><U+0002>ā<U+0002> a<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nwide<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nworld<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nof<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nnew<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nsights<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nand<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nexperiences!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
